	'SELECT d, t, ts, tstz, iv FROM corpus WHERE id % 50 NOT BETWEEN 15 AND 29 ORDER BY id', 'postgres');
 col |            type             |       layout       | arrow |       extension        
-----+-----------------------------+--------------------+-------+------------------------
   1 | date                        | fixed(4,postgres)  | i     | postgresql.date
   2 | time without time zone      | fixed(8)           | ttu   | 
   3 | timestamp without time zone | fixed(8,postgres)  | l     | postgresql.timestamp
   4 | timestamp with time zone    | fixed(8,postgres)  | l     | postgresql.timestamptz
